stateDiagram-v2
    state "No challenge" as absent
    state "Issued, unverified" as issued
    state "Verification committed" as verified
    state "Cancelled" as cancelled
    state "OTP expired (derived)" as expired
    state "Result expired (derived)" as result_expired
    [*] --> absent
    absent --> issued: issue_email_otp!
    issued --> issued: issue_email_otp! replaces this flow generation
    issued --> verified: verify_email_otp! valid code and available budgets
    issued --> cancelled: cancel_email_otp_challenge! under parent and ceremony locks
    cancelled --> issued: issue_email_otp! creates a new generation
    issued --> issued: wrong code / shared budget refusal
    issued --> expired: OTP deadline elapsed
    verified --> verified: already_verified receipt before result deadline; not another consumption
    verified --> result_expired: result deadline elapsed
    note right of issued
        App/com sign-in receipt, verification and resend use this model.
        Delivery refuses stale generation, destination, code or binding before transport.
        Independent app/com Ticket storage; DB time rechecked after Contact ownership locks.
        Current surface, purpose, SID, parent and effective Contact facts required.
        Dummy generations cannot verify; Source OTP generations remain unchanged.
        Cancellation retains the terminal generation and refuses verification and delivery.
    end note
    note right of verified
        Reissue refuses committed proof. Retry retains original proof deadlines.
        success? reports first consumption only; verified_evidence? admits receipt continuation.
        Subordinate evidence only, never root or RP authority.
    end note
